OL,3,GNEWSA'The Corby to London train service
OL,4,Ais unviable'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"East Midlands Railway either don't
OL,7,Fhave the rolling stock or they don't
OL,8,Fhave the staff," says regular rail
OL,9,Ftraveller Matthew Aldridge.
OL,11,FHe is among train users on the Corby to
OL,12,FLondon St Pancras line who have
OL,13,Fcontacted their MP Lee Barron
OL,14,Fcomplaining about the unreliability of
OL,15,Fthe service.
OL,17,FAldridge, from Thrapston,
OL,18,FNorthamptonshire, said his daughter has
OL,19,Foften been stranded at Huntingdon,
OL,20,FCambridgeshire, or Bedford, requiring
OL,21,Fhim to collect her.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,367,360,200,160,0,100
